### Local: home
GET http://localhost:3000/ HTTP/1.1

### Local: all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1

### Local: single contact (paste an _id from the response above)
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/REPLACE_WITH_ID HTTP/1.1

### Local: single contact by query parameter
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts?id=REPLACE_WITH_ID HTTP/1.1

### Local: create a contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1995-04-12"
}

### Local: update a contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/REPLACE_WITH_ID HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Green",
  "birthday": "1995-04-12"
}

### Local: delete a contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/REPLACE_WITH_ID HTTP/1.1

